      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S PEAKIN' (4) has a terrific record this track and trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Recorded a 7 length win (34.53) in a Other last time at this track. Looks suited and should go close. ADHANA MARTINA (8) was an impressive winner last time in quickest of the meeting when scoring by 9 lengths (34.86) at this track. Deserved serious consideration again. COOL BLUE YOU (5) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing second (31.41) at this track in a Grade 5 over 530m. The form from her last run stacks up well. Expected to be in this for a long way. KING OF SNAKE (2) placed two runs ago then again in the money last time when third (43.69) at this track in a Free For All.",
